verses:
Luyando lwenu lutaambiki
Lwaboneka ‘muluwo, muzuba;
Luleenda malundu a’mabanda;
Lwaboneka mumume amvula.

Myozo yesu yoonse
Ainjilwe nguwe;
Ati isalale, Sibi sikatandwe.

Amba ciingano cakwe,
Amba kuciswa kwakwe;
Amba nkwaakazikwa Jesu,
Amba wabuka ‘limwi;
Luyando olu lupati,
Ndalubonesya lyoonse;
Ndayanda kumwaambila,
“Luyando lwakandilungila!”

Nguni uwakaseluka?
Jesu, Mufutuli;
‘Wakeza Mufutuli;
Jesu, Mufutuli.

Omwe watusozya, bakwesu,
Jesu, Mwami Jesu;
Uwatufutula, bakwesu,
Jesu, Mwami Jesu;
Wakeendeenda ansi ano,
Wakaambila aswebo;
Ulaziba kubaazya boonse,
Jesu, Mwami Jesu.

Ulatuteelela, bakwesu,
Jesu, Mwami Jesu;
Waponya baciswa, bakwesu,
Jesu, Mwami Jesu;
Ababfunwa, natwaandana,
Imisozi natulalila;
Ulasozya myoyo yesu,
Jesu, Mwami Jesu.

Ulatujatisya, bakwesu,
Jesu, Mwami Jesu;
Ulatuumuzya, bakwesu,
Jesu, Mwami Jesu;
Luse lwakwe tulalubula,
Tulayanda luyando lwakwe;
Atukombe ku-Mwami toonse,
Jesu, Mwami Jesu.

Acilundu kule, kwali ciingano,
Ncikozyano cabupenzi;
Nkwakatila bulowa bwakwe.

choruses.text:
Wakabuka kukufwa,
Tulumbe bulemu bwa-Leza;
Wakazunda lufu azintu zyoonse,
Jesu upona mumazuba oonse;
Wabuka kulufu,
Wakabuka wapona.

verses:
Wategwa Sikuusa,
Mwana wa-Mwami Leza;
Wanununa babisyi;
Aleluya! Mufutuli!

Nguwe watuyumwida
Nsoni azibi zyesu;
Walekelela ndiswe;
Aleluya! Mufutuli!

Wakafwa a-Ciingano
“Kwamana,” wakakwiila;
Lino uli kujulu;
Aleluya! Mufutuli!

Ndivumbe, Muuya Mubotu;
Kosanzya buumi bwangu;
Koboola eno ndapenga;
Kondizuzya aa-Muuya.

Majwi akabotezya, amwiimbe kulindime,
Ndibone kubotezya, majwi alufutuko;
Majwi akabota, alatupa luse.

Alapegwa aa-Kristo, majwi alufutuko,
Mumwe nyoonse nobabi, majwi alufutuko;
Majwi al’ abuumi, alapegwa nywebo.

Amumvwe makani nywebo, majwi alufutuko;
Alamupa kukondwa, majwi alufutuko;
Ulajatilwa, ncipegwa ca-Jesu.

Twateelela kukondwa, uvuna, uvuna;
Komwaya amakani, uvuna, uvuna;
Tola kaambo kumasi koonse kwitala lwizi;
Koya nkwaamba Mwami, uvuna, uvuna.

Koompolola enguzu, uvuna, uvuna;
Kobaambila babisyi, uvuna, uvuna;
Koimbisya ziluzi, ayebo lwizi vuwa;
Inyika ilakwiimba, uvuna, uvuna.

Nko kwiimba mulumamba, uvuna, uvuna;
Alufu lwakwe jesu, uvuna, uvuna;
Uimbe mangolezya, nolomba luzyalo;
Imba kuzunda cuumbwe, uvuna, uvuna.

Luwo alwaambisye, uvuna, uvuna;
Masi akomanisye, uvuna, uvuna;
Moompolole kuvunwa, malundu omilindi;
Alwiimbo lwakuzunda, uvuna, uvuna.

choruses.text:
Bubotu buzuba,
Jesu wandigwisya kubi;
Wandiyoosya kukomba,
Akukomanisya lyoonse;
Bubotu buzuba,
Jesu wandigwisya kubi.

verses:
Uyanda kubota ’nyika yainda;
Kopaila lyoonse alike Jesu;
Wamulanga Jesu, ube mbwabede.
Buumi bwakwe buyoolangwa ku’nduwe.

Uyanda kubota, Jesu Ngugwasya;
Utaciti cintu citabotezyi;
Kukondwa na kuusa, tumutobele,
Ulange kwa-Jesu, syoma ’jwi lyakwe.

Uyanda kubota, komunikisya;
Koyeeya milimo ya-Mwami wesu;
Tuzolwede Jesu, munzila yako,
Noyakubambilwa, kukal’ a-Mwami.

Nkenaba mbuli Jesu,
’Kupenzya bamupenzya;
Walo katabweedezya;
||Kwalo wabakombela.||

Ndisololela Jehova,
Ndili mulweendo lwangu;
Ulaanguzu, ime nyina,
Ndijatilila eno;
Mufutuli, Mufutuli,
||Nduwe Muvuni wangu.||

Jalula kasensa kako;
Kalabaponya bantu;
Leta kusalala kwako,
Kundisololele lyoonse.
Mwaangululi, Mwaangululi,
||Koba intobo yangu.||

Kuti ndasika kulufu,
Gwisya kuyoowa kwangu;
Andinjile julu lyako,
Koba Mugwasyi wangu;
Njakwiimba, njakwiimba,
||Nyimbo zyalutangalo.||

choruses.text:
Jesu alike ndi-Bbwe lyangu;
Zimana nsiziyandi,
Zimana nsiziyandi pe.

verses:
Ndajana mweenzuma mwini,
Wandiyanda lutanzi;
Nenditaninga muyanda,
Wandyanga luyando;
Wauzambaila moyo,
Intambo yaluyando,
Ndili wakwe, uli wangu;
Ngwangu oku tamani.

Jesu wazyalwa muciba,
Weenda kucuungano;
Watila bulowa bwakwe
Wafwa kutufutula;
Wakabuka acuumbwe,
Waunka kujulu;
Eneeno ulaboola,
Mumakumbi akujulu.

Lumba, lumba, Jesu Muvuni wesu,
Imba, imba, luyanda aluse;
Anzya, anzya, Leza uyiinda zyoonse;
Kolemeka izina lyakwe;
Mweembezi, Jesu ubamba bakwe;
Mumaboko ubabweza lyoonse.

Lumba, lumba, Jesu Muvuni wesu,
Muvuni wakapenga azibi;
Ndebbwe, lyalusyomo lyalufutuko,
Anzya, anzya, Jesu ubambulwa;
Lumba, lumba, wabweza zibi zyesu
Luse lwakwe ndupati, ndulamfu.

Lumba, lumba, Jesu Muvuni wesu,
’Nyimbo zinji zyaimbwa kujulu;
Jesu Kristo uyakulela lyoonse
Mucite Musinsimi aa-Mwami;
Ulaboola kuzunda nyika yoonse;
Kulinguwe akube bulemu.

Ndilamwaambila mapenzi angu;
Nsikonzyi kuyumuna mukuli;
Mumais’ angu ulandigwasya;
Ulandiyand’ akundibamba.

Ndilamwaambila mapenzi oonse;
Ngooyu mweenzuma Siluzyalo;
Nandamukumbila ulandipa;
Ulagwasya mapenzi angu.

Babi bayanda kundizolweda;
Moyo wangu uyanda kubisya;
Ndilamwaambila, ulandigwasya,
Kuzunda Saatani munyika.

Amunyonene Jesu, busiku buleza
Nyonena zuba lyoonse, akulyookezya;
Nyonena zuba lyoonse, kabotu kabotu,
Eno nyona anguzu;
Ulalyookezya.

Nombungano yakwe Mukasame nyoonse;
Tulaya bulwana, Tulwa a-Saatani.
Musolozi wesu Uli Kristo Jesu;
Uli Mwami, Musunguli, Uli Mufutuli.

Fwamba uzumine, koboola;
Fwamba uzumine, utakaki;
Jesu ulakwiita, baangelo abalo,
Bayandika bapaila, boola.

Fwamba uzumine, waindwa;
Fwamba uzumine, wasweeka;
Fwamba uzumine, kunyina kugwasya
Uya kulilila mumudima.

Ulazijatila zyoonse;
Mbube ulaziluba;
Ulazijatila zyoonse,
Mbube ulaziluba.
Amumusyome nyoonse,
Amutubye bu!
Ulazijatila zyoonse,
Ulazijatila zyoonse;
Mbube ulaziluba,
Mbube ulazilube.

Jesu ulalnda, boola eno;
Boola eno, boola eno;
Leta zibi zyako, kotama;
Boola, utmuki pe.

Utamutandi Mufutuli
Wakwiita sunu aluse;
Amumvwe ijwi
Akusala Jesu;
Utatandi Mufutuli.

Utamutandi Mufutuli
Kuli mapenzi kumuka;
Toonse tulafwa,
Akulaya boonse;
Utamutandi Mufutuli.

Kujulu kuya kuba kubotelwa
Nkaambo wakazunda lufu;
Ndayanda wakazunda lufu;
“Koboola, mwanaangu.”
Ndiyoobotelwa, Jesu,
Waboola kunditola.

Koswena andime,
Jesu, ndakomba;
Afwaafwi andime
Lyoonse alyoonse;
Kolongezya bana
Boonse munyika;
Tutole kujulu
Kukala ’nduwe.

O Nyenyeezi ya-Bet’lehemu,
Omwekela alindiswe,
Wakamunikisya bantu banji;
Wakasolwedela basongo
Kuyoojana Mwana Jesu;
O Nyenyeezi ’mbotu komwekela.

O Nyenyeezi ya-Bet’lehemu,
Ulatugwasya asunu;
Kotutondezya znila masiku,
Tuenzya munzila kabotu
Kusikila lufu lwesu;
O Nyenyeezi ’mbotu komwekela.

Nkaambo Kristo wazyalwa
Sunu kuli-Mariya;
Masiku abangelo
Balamulangila;
O nyenyeezi, koamba
Kuzyalwa kwakwe;
Imba kulumbaizya
Kuli-Leza Mwami.

Mubuumuzi Leza
Wapa cipo cigambya;
Munzila eyo mumonya
Mbwaanjila mumoyo;
Kwiina matwi akonzya
Kumvwa naaboola;
Ulanjila kubantu Abamutambula.

O Mwana wa-Bet’lehemu,
Boola kulindiswe;
Gwisya izibi zyesu,
Swezya myoyo yesu;
Kokalilila aswe,
O Mwami Jesu;
Kokala mazuba oonse,
Emanuele!

Walo wakaselukila ansi,
Ngu-Leza, Singuzuzyoonse;
Namakungwe wakalibombya,
Ulilede mucimpati;
Mufutuli, Mulengi,
Wakakala abacete.

Jesu uinda zyoonse, ulandipa buumi;
Ninguzu zyangu lyoonse, kakwina nguwe ndawa.
Ndausa ndainka kwakwe, ulandibotezya buya;
Ulandipa kubotelwa, Mweenzuma!

Jesu uinda zyoonse, mapenzi naasika;
Lyoonse ndainka kwakwe, nditainka ndilawa;
Ndamubula, nkwali lyoonse, takatali
kundigwasya;
Zilongezyo ulandipa, Mweenzuma!

Jesu uinda zyoonse, ndilamutobela;
Mebo nsikapiluki, pe; utandisiy’ endike;
Kumucilila nsilubya; ndiyoolanga kuciingano,
Wakafwida kundivuna, Mweenzuma!

Jesu uinda zyoonse, nsiyandi umbi, pe;
Ndamusyoma mane nkwafwe, uyoonditola
kwakwe;
Buumi bubotu anguwe, bubotu ubutamani,
Kubotelwa kutamani, Mweenzuma!

Lino ndilongezegwa, nkaambo ndilaisigwa;
Nceeci cintu cibotu, ndibe mwana wakwe;
Ndizoobaswiilila abazyali bagu,
Ndimuyande Jehova, amoyo wangu oonse.

Ndiyakukombela mazuba amazuba,
Ndijane nguzu zyakwe ukuzunda zyoonse;
Leza undilongezye, asilongezyo zyako;
Undienzye kabotu, munzila yako yoonse.

||Leta mulilo undyuumpe, o-Mwami!||
Leta mulilo, kujulu, undyuumpe;
Leta mulilo, uudyuumpe.

Akundiita njookuvuwa;
Akundiita njookuvuwa;
Akundiita njookuvuwa;
Njookuvuwa izina lyangu.
||Konyonena, nyona, nyona, nyona.
Nyona, nyona, nyona, nyonena, Mwami.||

||Ivangeli, ivangeli, I
vangeli, lilempuwo;||
NoBakristo, amutole majwi aya;
NoBakristo, amutole majwi aya;
NoBakristo, amutole majwi aya;
Ivangeli lilempuwo
Twati, “Jesu, Jesu, aleluya!”
Twati, “Jesu, Jesu, aleluya!”
Twati, “Jesu, Jesu, aleluya!”
Ivangeli lilempuwo.

choruses.text:
Ndime kubuka abuumi; oyo uusyoma ndime,
Nanooli wafwa, unooli muumi;
Takwe, takwe nayoofwa, pe pe.

verses:
Cenjela omeso ncobona, cenjela omeso ncobona;
Nkwali Taata kujulu utulanga ’luyando;
Cenjela omeso ncobona.

Ulakunka, ulakunka; moyo wangu ulakunka;
Kuzwa nendasyoma lyoonse ndabotelwa,
Moyo wangu ulakunka!

Ndabotelwa nkaambo ndili mu-Kristo;
Ndasyoma Jehova, akumulumba;
Ndabala Baibele, ndasyoma Ijwi;
Izibi zyainda, zilijatidwe.

Kububi ndiliangulukide;
Ndil’ aacikalilo mujulu oko;
Mukwesu fwambana, tukatobele;
Jesu ulaboola, tukamucinge.

Moyo wangu wakali kusia muzibi;
Ndilizi bulowa bwa-Jesu bwandisanzya.
Mujwi lyakwe ndaambilwa, njooenda ango-lida;
Bwakali buzuba ’botu naakatubya mumoyo.

Ulapona, Jesu ulapona;
Ulaenda ulaamba andime munzila;
Ulapona kupa lufutuko;
Ndilizi buti wapona? Mwali mulindime.

Jesu ulayanda bana, boonse bana munyika;
Abasiya, ’Salala, MaIndi, MaJapani,
Jesu ulayanda bana boonse.

Buya Leza mbwaakayanda nyika;
Wakapa Mwanaakwe Simuzyalwa alike;
Kuti umwi uumusyoma atakafwi
Pele abe abuum, Buumi, butakoooomana.

Leka kupenga, kopaila;
Syoma Jesu, abe Mwami wako;
Utabi mbuli Tomasi, wakamuka kusyoma;
Koleka kupenga, leka kupenga; kopaila.

Uleelede Kuyandisya Leza;
Uleelede kuyandisya Leza;
Aleluya, uleelede kuyandisya Leza,
Notakanjili kujulu.

Jesu ulatuyanda toonse,
Jesu ulatuyanda toonse, ati “Nobana bangu”;
Jesu ulatuyanda toonse tukale anguwe.
Jesu ulaboola ’limwi,
Jesu ulaboola ’limwi omuno munyika;
Jesu ulaboola alimwi kutola bantu bakwe.
